{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"I|strong=\"H1980\"will|strong=\"H6440\"bless the|strong=\"H6440\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"at|strong=\"H1732\"all|strong=\"H6440\"times|strong=\"H6440\".  \nHis|strong=\"H1732\"praise will|strong=\"H6440\"always be|strong=\"H6440\"in|strong=\"H1980\"my|strong=\"H1732\"mouth|strong=\"H6440\".   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"My|strong=\"H3605\"soul shall|strong=\"H3068\"boast|strong=\"H1288\"in|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\".  \nThe|strong=\"H3605\"humble shall|strong=\"H3068\"hear of|strong=\"H3068\"it|strong=\"H3068\"and|strong=\"H3068\"be|strong=\"H3068\"glad.   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"Oh magnify the|strong=\"H8085\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"with|strong=\"H3068\"me|strong=\"H5315\".  \nLet|strong=\"H8055\"’s exalt his|strong=\"H3068\"name together|strong=\"H8085\".   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"I|strong=\"H3068\"sought the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", and|strong=\"H3068\"he|strong=\"H3068\"answered me|strong=\"H7311\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"delivered|strong=\"H3068\"me|strong=\"H7311\"from|strong=\"H3068\"all|strong=\"H3162\"my|strong=\"H3068\"fears.   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"They|strong=\"H3068\"looked|strong=\"H3068\"to|strong=\"H3068\"him|strong=\"H3605\", and|strong=\"H3068\"were|strong=\"H3068\"radiant.  \nTheir|strong=\"H3605\"faces shall|strong=\"H3068\"never be|strong=\"H3068\"covered with|strong=\"H3068\"shame.   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"This|strong=\"H6440\"poor man|strong=\"H6440\"cried, and|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"heard him|strong=\"H6440\",  \nand|strong=\"H6440\"saved him|strong=\"H6440\"out|strong=\"H6440\"of|strong=\"H6440\"all|strong=\"H6440\"his|strong=\"H6440\"troubles.   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"The|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s angel encamps around those|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"fear him|strong=\"H7121\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"delivers|strong=\"H3467\"them|strong=\"H7121\".   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"Oh taste and|strong=\"H3068\"see that|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"is|strong=\"H3068\"good.  \nBlessed is|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"man who|strong=\"H3068\"takes refuge in|strong=\"H2583\"him|strong=\"H5439\".   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"Oh fear the|strong=\"H7200\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", you|strong=\"H3588\"his|strong=\"H3068\"saints,  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"there|strong=\"H3068\"is|strong=\"H3068\"no|strong=\"H7200\"lack with|strong=\"H3068\"those|strong=\"H3588\"who|strong=\"H3068\"fear him|strong=\"H7200\".   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"The|strong=\"H3588\"young lions do|strong=\"H3068\"lack|strong=\"H4270\", and|strong=\"H3068\"suffer hunger,  \nbut|strong=\"H3588\"those|strong=\"H3588\"who|strong=\"H3068\"seek the|strong=\"H3588\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"shall|strong=\"H3068\"not|strong=\"H3588\"lack|strong=\"H4270\"any|strong=\"H3588\"good thing|strong=\"H3588\".   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"Come, you|strong=\"H3605\"children, listen|strong=\"H3605\"to|strong=\"H3068\"me|strong=\"H1875\".  \nI|strong=\"H3808\"will|strong=\"H3068\"teach you|strong=\"H3605\"the|strong=\"H3605\"fear of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\".   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"Who|strong=\"H3068\"is|strong=\"H3068\"someone who|strong=\"H3068\"desires life,  \nand|strong=\"H1121\"loves many days, that|strong=\"H8085\"he|strong=\"H3068\"may|strong=\"H3068\"see good?   \n"},{"number":13,"text":"Keep|strong=\"H7200\"your|strong=\"H7200\"tongue from|strong=\"H3117\"evil,  \nand|strong=\"H3117\"your|strong=\"H7200\"lips from|strong=\"H3117\"speaking lies.   \n"},{"number":14,"text":"Depart from|strong=\"H7451\"evil|strong=\"H7451\", and|strong=\"H1696\"do|strong=\"H8193\"good.  \nSeek peace, and|strong=\"H1696\"pursue it|strong=\"H5341\".   \n"},{"number":15,"text":"The|strong=\"H6213\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s eyes are|strong=\"H6213\"toward|strong=\"H6213\"the|strong=\"H6213\"righteous.  \nHis|strong=\"H5493\"ears listen to|strong=\"H6213\"their|strong=\"H1245\"cry.   \n"},{"number":16,"text":"The|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s face|strong=\"H5869\"is|strong=\"H3068\"against|strong=\"H3068\"those who|strong=\"H3068\"do|strong=\"H3068\"evil,  \nto|strong=\"H3068\"cut off their|strong=\"H3068\"memory from|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"earth.   \n"},{"number":17,"text":"The|strong=\"H6440\"righteous cry, and|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H6440\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"hears,  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"delivers them|strong=\"H6440\"out|strong=\"H6213\"of|strong=\"H3068\"all|strong=\"H6213\"their|strong=\"H3068\"troubles|strong=\"H7451\".   \n"},{"number":18,"text":"The|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"is|strong=\"H3068\"near to|strong=\"H3068\"those|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"have|strong=\"H3068\"a|strong=\"H3068\"broken heart|strong=\"H8085\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"saves|strong=\"H5337\"those|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"have|strong=\"H3068\"a|strong=\"H3068\"crushed spirit.   \n"},{"number":19,"text":"Many are|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"afflictions of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"righteous,  \nbut|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"delivers|strong=\"H3467\"him|strong=\"H3068\"out of|strong=\"H3068\"them|strong=\"H7665\"all|strong=\"H3467\".   \n"},{"number":20,"text":"He|strong=\"H3068\"protects all|strong=\"H3605\"of|strong=\"H3068\"his|strong=\"H3605\"bones.  \nNot|strong=\"H7451\"one|strong=\"H3605\"of|strong=\"H3068\"them|strong=\"H5337\"is|strong=\"H3068\"broken.   \n"},{"number":21,"text":"Evil shall|strong=\"H3808\"kill the|strong=\"H3605\"wicked.  \nThose|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"hate the|strong=\"H3605\"righteous shall|strong=\"H3808\"be|strong=\"H3808\"condemned.   \n"},{"number":22,"text":"The|strong=\"H4191\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"redeems the|strong=\"H4191\"soul of|strong=\"H4191\"his|strong=\"H8130\"servants.  \nNone of|strong=\"H4191\"those|strong=\"H8130\"who|strong=\"H6662\"take refuge in|strong=\"H4191\"him|strong=\"H4191\"shall|strong=\"H7563\"be|strong=